  "description": "The Huffy Stone Mountain 20\" Mountain Bike gives growing riders a rugged, confidence-building ride for neighborhood streets, parks, and light trails. A durable steel frame pairs with a front suspension fork to help smooth bumps, giving young riders the comfort and control to explore with confidence.\nA Shimano 6-speed drivetrain with easy-to-use twist shifting helps riders find the right gear for hills, flats, and changing terrain. Front and rear linear pull brakes provide dependable stopping power, making it easier to stay confidently in control wherever the ride leads.\n20\" x 1.95\" knobby all-terrain tires provide reliable traction across pavement, dirt, and light trails. Sized for riders 44–56 inches tall, the Stone Mountain delivers a comfortable, confident fit, while an included kickstand and derailleur guard add everyday convenience and protection.",
